cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model or its documentation, please cite it as below."
title: "Taxi-out time at ten European airports: two processes in one column"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A post-operational estimator of the taxi-out time (take-off minus off-block) of a departure at ten European airports,
  built for the EUROCONTROL PRC Data Challenge 2026. It estimates for each departure the probability that the recorded
  off-block is a copy of the schedule and mixes a physical taxi estimate with the schedule delay accordingly.
authors:
